  "system": {
    "finalName": "",
    "description": "<p><i>Reference Book: <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Star_Wars_Saga_Edition_Jedi_Academy_Training_Manual\" title=\"Star Wars Saga Edition Jedi Academy Training Manual\">Star Wars Saga Edition Jedi Academy Training Manual</a></i> </p><p>Found on <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Barab_I\" title=\"Barab I\">Barab I</a>, a Barab Ingot is a special crystal found inside ore littering the planet's <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Radiation\" title=\"Radiation\">Radiation</a>-baked surface. Though the <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Radiation\" title=\"Radiation\">Radiation</a> on the surface of the planet makes it difficult to find these crystals, a few <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Jedi\" title=\"Jedi\">Jedi</a> have managed to locate Barab Ingots suitable for use as <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Lightsaber_Crystals\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Lightsaber Crystals\">Lightsaber Crystals</a>. However, the constant infusion of <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Radiation\" title=\"Radiation\">Radiation</a> on the surface of <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Barab_I\" title=\"Barab I\">Barab I</a> causes a Barab Ingot to produce a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Lightsaber\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Lightsaber\">Lightsaber</a> blade that burns like <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Fire\" title=\"Fire\">Fire</a>. A <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Lightsaber\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Lightsaber\">Lightsaber</a> constructed with a Barab Ingot deals <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Fire\" title=\"Fire\">Fire</a> damage instead of energy and slashing damage. Any target that takes damage from the weapon also catches on <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Fire\" title=\"Fire\">Fire</a>. </p>",
